    936  f150							; --- Advance to next tile row (X clobbered by object section: reload) ---
    937  f150							; Phase C vcrunch shutter: while the band's slice run is live
    938  f150							; (RowIdx == VcrBand, VcrNext in 1..4) the row does NOT advance — the
    939  f150							; tail hands the setup line to RowSlice, which renders the next
    940  f150							; sub-slice of the shutter band and jumps to SliceReentry. Slice path
    941  f150							; ≈59c + jmp 3c = 62c from the previous WSYNC (<=73 => single line);
    942  f150							; non-shutter pass-end +10c (three zp compares — VcrNext=0 is the
    943  f150							; idle marker so a title-stomp VcrBand=0 coincidences cannot slice)
    944  f150							; — measured segments stay under the 152c double-line ceiling.
    945  f150							; RowSlice lives in the $FBD0 fill hole (below). TAIL JMP, not jsr:
    946  f150							; the slice loop would otherwise push 4 returns per frame that the
    947  f150							; jmp re-entry never pops (stack decay — F6-hotspot family), and the
    948  f150							; old jsr + rts + lda/sta GRP0 + jmp tail was +14c on the first body
    949  f150							; line after each slice setup (82c measured; >=74 = stall line).
    950  f150							; SP: ZERO extra dips at kernel depth (jsr removed) — sim_bomb_fuse
    951  f150							; gate (gameplay min SP >= $F8) can only improve.
    952  f150							; SliceReentry is a GLOBAL label: .Line is local to CaveKernelRow's
    953  f150							; scope and is not referenceable from RowSlice's scope (DASM has no
