   1049  f1a4							; --- Call bank1 for 13+2 HUD rendering via fold-pad at $FC68 ---
   1050  f1a4							; The fold-pad at $FC68 has identical bytes in bank0 and bank1:
   1051  f1a4							;   $FC68: lda #1 / sta $1FF7 / jmp $F540
