   1139  f214							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1140  f214							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1141  f214							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1142  f214							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1143  f214							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
