   1217  f26d							; --- Physics: vy += GRAVITY (gravity), vy -= JetPower (jet thrust). ---
   1218  f26d							;     JetPower b7 = float flag (bugs #31): float frames add gravity
   1219  f26d							;     only — subtracting $80+ would blast the player upward.
   1220  f26d				   .Gravity
