   2557  f926							; PlayerHitsMap — check player bounding box against the room's PF map
   2558  f926							; ==============================================================================
   2559  f926							; Boxes are in tile coordinates (col 0-19, row 0-2); the walk tests the
   2560  f926							; PF0/1/2Buf cell bits directly (cell_collision_plan 2.1) — no rect cache,
   2561  f926							; no rect-count limit. The playfield is reflected, so right-half display
   2562  f926							; cols mirror via 39-col IN THE PROLOGUE (walk sees left-half only).
   2563  f926							; Returns C=0 if clear, C=1 if blocked.
   2564  f926				   PlayerHitsMap
   2565  f926							; --- Tile row range (top, bottom) ---
   2566  f926							; Inlined row lookup: saves 2 JSR stack push levels (4B on stack) to keep SP >= $F8
