   2754  f9c4							;		     M1 one clock left of the [A-7,A] player contract).
   2755  f9c4							;		     ENAM1 latched #$02 for the whole cave (hero-style: 2
   2756  f9c4							;		     ENAM writes/frame — enable here, clear in .AfterRows);
   2757  f9c4							;		     walls hide the parked M1 in unpatched bands (PF > M1 in
   2758  f9c4							;		     the priority chain — convert enforces the solid cell).
   2759  f9c4							; Runs before the single HMOVE (HMP0+X shadow registers accumulate).
   2760  f9c4							; Sym path cost: jsr+rts overhead only — no RESP/HMP write, frames stay
