   3741  ff5e		       d0 3a		      bne	.LaserInit
   3742  ff60							; --- travel: +/-4 px toward the facing (PlayerDir live), capped at the
   3743  ff60							; old S3 sweep extent (SweepOff max 16: right tip <= RoomX+20, left
   3744  ff60							; floor max(RoomX-20,0)) — past the cap restarts at the eye, the
   3745  ff60							; triangle-loop feel of the sweep (user: beam "moved way beyond the
   3746  ff60							; limit"). RectCount = free scratch (LWC re-owns it for its row walk).
   3747  ff60				   .LAdvStep
   3748  ff60		       a4 82		      ldy	PlayerDir
   3749  ff62		       a5 83		      lda	LaserX
   3750  ff64		       18		      clc
